OL,3,GNEWSAJersey over-50s win walking
OL,4,Afootball title
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey over-50s walking footballers are
OL,7,FEuropean champions after beating
OL,8,FEngland on penalties.
OL,10,FThe island side finished second in the
OL,11,Fgroup stage with a win against the
OL,12,Fhosts Spain, before beating France in
OL,13,Fthe semi-final. Luke Heynes scored the
OL,14,Fisland's only goal in the final that
OL,15,Fended in a 1-1 draw and after a
OL,16,Fgoalless extra time it was decided from
OL,17,Fthe penalty spot.
OL,19,FManager Jean-Luc Desbois called it a
OL,20,F"seismic" win against England's Over
OL,21,F50's.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
