OL,3,GNEWSAJersey over-50s win walking
OL,4,Afootball title
OL,5,
OL,6,F"They've won every major tournament
OL,7,Fthey've entered in the last four years
OL,8,Fso for us to overcome them all be it on
OL,9,Fpenalties in a tough very, very close
OL,10,Fmatch I think we got our just desserts
OL,11,Fand I think we thoroughly deserved it,"
OL,12,Fhe said.
